    "title": "Indie Cross V1 Digital Battles",
    "description": "Welcome to Indie World!\r\nTonight is your first time to Indie wonderland. So, let's have fun with Indie.EXE mod where Boyfriend rap-battle against all horror characters such as Undertale, and Ink Demon from Bendy to protect Girlfiend (GF) in danger and escape out of Indie wonderland.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Tap the note as it reaches scoring area.\r\n- Challenge yourself with all hard mode.\r\n- NOTICE: Becareful with special note, if you don't wanna play that song one more time immediately.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES\r\n- Play online/offline mode anytime as you want\r\n- Full catchy song with digital rhythm\r\n- Full mods All horror characters as you expected (QT, Impostor V4-V5, Silly Billy, twiddlefinger)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Different difficulty makes more choices\r\n- Great sound effect help your game experience better\r\n- Be updated weekly!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow our social media platforms to jump into vibrant game community!",
